Enterprise Procurement System - Java Capstone
Case Study
Project Objective
Build a menu-driven Enterprise Procurement System using Java OOP, Collections, Exception
Handling, Java Stream API, Optional, Lambda Expressions, Comparator, and Java Time API. The
system manages vendors, products, purchase requests, purchase orders, inventory, approvals,
payments, and procurement analytics.
